    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      424.15,
      286.47,
      496.84
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the 1964 No. 28 of Government intends to acquire the following lands which are required for a public purpose.",
