      346.16,
      539.64,
      367.76
    ],
    "text": "Original Claimant\u2019s Name Address: C. L. P. Daiyas Kostha; Extent: 0.0007 Hectares.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      369.87,
      564.8,
      498.8
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid lands are hereby required to appear personally or by agent duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretariat office Sri Jayawardhanapura Kotte on the 20th April, 2015 at 10.30 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 10th day of April, 2015 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said lands, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
